aquinas-second-way.md:1: argue/readings: S4 is read 2 ways: aquinas-second-way.logic.r3 has "¬◇infinite"; aquinas-second-way.logic.r3.2 and aquinas-second-way.logic.r3.3 have nothing from it; they differ when only "possibly, in efficient causes one goes on to infinity" is true, which the second allows
